   "why": "Same source as r_fcp1 with rasterSampleCount 4 -- a controlled comparison under one changed pipeline parameter (NOT a byte-for-byte pair: Metal lowers the multisampled fragment build differently, per EXP-0163's corrected sec.2). Four constant-per-sample channels resolve to exactly their own value, so the oracle is unchanged."
